   150	
   151	A **labelled example project** (the example fixture in the supplied review pack, `input/fannan-review-pack/example-project-*`) is used only as a dry-run of the workflow, in `references/example-project-check.md`. Its draft rules, absent authoritative brief/fact register and missing role/stack mappings are detected as blockers. Its project claims are not transplanted into this plan or promoted to confirmed facts.
   152	
   153	All local command results and negative-path checks are in the separate verification record. Anything not executed is in the untested list. Historical test claims stay historical. This candidate does not create Amin's review, live credentials, branch enforcement, provider access, a real approved design or a successful live handoff.
