    13	6. **Critic:** a separate read-only reviewer scores copy and design together using [critic rubric](../../references/critic-rubric.md) and real references. Fix and rescore at most three rounds. Stop if a round gains <1 total point. A cap or stalled score is never a soft pass; send the scores and open defects to the approver. Any P0/P1 blocks handoff.
    14	7. **Harden:** before Step 9 run `FANNAN_DEPS=... node "$FANNAN_RELEASE/tools/pre-handoff-check.mjs" <DESIGN.md> <page.html> <evidence-dir> <project> <handoff.json> --phase=handoff`. Require PASS evidence and complete [handoff contract](../../references/handoff-contract.md). WCAG 2.2 AA is the minimum.
